erence: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/PWK/issues/111.", "gloss_language": "de"}], "synonyms": ["दमनं", "दमनः"], "synonyms_slp1": ["damanaM", "damanaH"]}], "damanaka": [{"id": "damanaka", "headword": "दमनक", "headword_slp1": "damanaka", "fold": "damanaka", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "bohtlingk-sanskrit-worterbuch-in-kurzerer-fassung", "senses": [{"gloss": "— 1〉 m.\n — a〉 Artemisia indica.\n — b〉 N. pr.\n — α〉 eines Mannes.\n — β〉 eines Schakals.\n— 2〉 wohl n. Bez. zweier Metra.", "gloss_language": "de"}], "synonyms": ["दमनकः"], "synonyms_slp1": ["damanakaH"]}], "damanaBaYjika": [{"id": "damanaBaYjikA", "headword": "दमनभञ्जिका", "headword_slp1": "damanaBaYjikA", "fold": "damanaBaYjika", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "bohtlingk-sanskrit-worterbuch-in-kurzerer-fassung", "senses": [{"gloss": "दमनभञ्जिका f. ein best. Spiel.", "gloss_language": "de"}]}], "damany": [{"id": "damany", "headword": "दमन्य्", "headword_slp1": "damany", "fold": "damany", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "bohtlingk-sanskrit-worterbuch-in-kurzerer-fassung", "senses": [{"gloss": "!√दमन्य्, दमन्यति bändigen, bezwingen ṚV.", "gloss_language": "de"}]}], "damamaya": [{"id": "damamaya", "headword": "दममय", "headword_slp1": "damamaya", "fold": "damamaya", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "bohtlingk-sanskrit-worterbuch-in-kurzerer-fassung", "senses": [{"gloss": "दममय Adj. dessen Wesen in Selbstbeherrschung besteht.", "gloss_language": "de"}]}], "damayantika": [{"id": "damayantikA", "headword": "दमयन्तिका", "headword_slp1": "damayantikA", "fold": "damayantika", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "bohtlingk-sanskrit-worterbuch-in-kurzerer-fassung", "senses": [{"gloss": "दमयन्तिका f. ein Frauenname.", "gloss_language": "de"}]}], "damayanti": [{"id": "damayantI", "headword": "दमयन्ती", "headword_slp1": "damayantI", "fold": "damayanti", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "bohtlingk-sanskrit-worterbuch-in-kurzerer-fassung", "senses": [{"gloss": "दमयन्ती f.\n— 1〉 N. pr. der Gatt